{"created": "2022-10-28T11:28:18.943861+00:00", "modified": "2022-10-28T14:26:25.860356+00:00", "id": 7254221, "conceptrecid": "7254220", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7254221", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.7254220", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7254221", "metadata": {"title": "ESA WorldCover 10 m 2021 v200", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7254221", "publication_date": "2022-10-28", "description": "<p><strong>ESA WorldCover 10 m 2021&nbsp;v200</strong></p>\n\n<p>The European Space Agency (ESA) WorldCover 10 m 2021&nbsp;product provides a global land cover map for 2021&nbsp;at 10 m resolution based on Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 data. The WorldCover product comes with 11 land cover classes,&nbsp;aligned with UN-FAO&#39;s Land Cover Classification System, and has been generated in the framework of the ESA WorldCover project.</p>\n\n<p>The ESA WorldCover 10m 2021 v200 product updates the existing <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5571936\">ESA WorldCover 10m 2020&nbsp;v100</a> product to 2021 but&nbsp;is produced using an improved algorithm version (v200) compared to the 2020 map. Consequently, since the <strong>WorldCover maps for 2020 and 2021 were generated with different algorithm versions</strong> (v100 and v200, respectively), <strong>changes between the maps</strong> should be treated with caution, as they i<strong>nclude both real changes in land cover and changes due to the algorithms used.</strong></p>\n\n<p>The WorldCover 2021 v200 product is developed by a consortium lead by VITO Remote Sensing&nbsp;together with&nbsp;partners Brockmann Consult, Gamma Remote Sensing AG, IIASA and Wageningen University</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://viewer.esa-worldcover.org/worldcover/\">Click here to view the maps</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://esa-worldcover.org\">More information about the land cover maps</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://esa-worldcover.org/en/data-access\">Product User Manual &amp; Product Validation Report</a></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Zanaga, Daniele", "affiliation": "VITO"}, {"name": "Van De Kerchove, Ruben", "affiliation": "VITO"}, {"name": "Daems, Dirk", "affiliation": "VITO"}, {"name": "De Keersmaecker, Wanda", "affiliation": "VITO"}, {"name": "Brockmann, Carsten", "affiliation": "Brockmann Consult"}, {"name": "Kirches, Grit", "affiliation": "Brockmann Consult"}, {"name": "Wevers, Jan", "affiliation": "Brockmann Consult"}, {"name": "Cartus, Oliver", "affiliation": "Gamma Remote Sensing"}, {"name": "Santoro, Maurizio", "affiliation": "Gamma Remote Sensing"}, {"name": "Fritz, Steffen", "affiliation": "International Institute for Applied Systems Analysis"}, {"name": "Lesiv, Myroslava", "affiliation": "International Institute for Applied Systems Analysis"}, {"name": "Herold, Martin", "affiliation": "Wageningen University, GFZ"}, {"name": "Tsendbazar, Nandin-Erdene", "affiliation": "Wageningen University"}, {"name": "Xu, Panpan", "affiliation": "Wageningen University"}, {"name": "Ramoino, Fabrizio", "affiliation": "SERCO c/o European Space Agency"}, {"name": "Arino, Olivier", "affiliation": "European Space Agency"}], "keywords": ["Land cover", "Land use", "Sentinel-1", "Sentinel-2", "Remote sensing", "European Space Agency"], "version": "v200", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "7254220"}}]}}, "title": "ESA WorldCover 10 m 2021 v200", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7254221", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7254221", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7254221?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7254221", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7254221", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.7254221", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7254221/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7254220", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/rec